class_name RelationshipAxis
## The independent dimensions of a relationship (see docs/SYSTEMS_BIBLE.md). They
## move separately on purpose: two characters can love each other and still have
## low TRUST and high RESENTMENT. Beats gate on COMBINATIONS, never one meter.
## Access as RelationshipAxis.TRUST etc.

enum { TRUST, UNDERSTANDING, ATTRACTION, RESENTMENT, VULNERABILITY, DEPENDENCE }
